# Tawasol CRM - Authentication API Tests
# Use VS Code REST Client extension or copy commands to terminal

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/auth
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 1. Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "User",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 2. Login with Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tawasol.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Login with Sales User
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.sales@tawasol.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile (requires authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update Profile (requires authentication)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Name"
}

### 6. Change Password (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 7. Refresh Access Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Test Unauthorized Access (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### 10. Test Invalid Login (should fail with 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tawasol.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}
